# graft/ is a regenerable cache of derived cards; every hit in it duplicates a
# hit in src/, and a card left stale by a skipped `graft build` reads as real.
# graft re-appends a `!graft/` re-admit to .ignore on every build, so the
# exclusion is pinned here — ripgrep gives .rgignore precedence over .ignore.
graft/
